 { Throughout the book we have seen several cases of active defence, such as Salov-Gligoric, Fressinet-Krämer, Ribli-Spassky and Kotronias-Berg, just to name a few. Here are some more. The fact that they are all rook endings is no coincidence - in precisely this type of ending, the difference between active and passive defence can be extraordinarily great. }  
 *

