Rxa2 8. Rxe4 h5 $1 { Exploiting the last resource of activity. } 9. c4 Kg2 10. Rf4 Rc2 11. Rh4 ( { Or } 11. Kd1 Rxf2 12. Rxf2 Kxf2 13. c5 h4 { and both sides queen. } ) 
Kf3 $1 ( { Rubinstein avoids the trap } 11... Rxf2 $2 12. Rh2 $1 Kxh2 13. Kxf2 ) 
